zxplore (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Go console: native Fyne GUI + fully static TUI from one codebase.
  * Transfer: delegation grants — replicate as an unprivileged user.
  * Servers: one-click setup, host-key reinstall recovery, reliable
    password prompts, explicit ssh user required before auth.
  * Fix: a loaded ssh-agent no longer breaks every connection.
  * Packaging now builds the Go tree (Architecture: any; was a bash
    prototype packaged as "all").

